{# 0201 - Frostfall Air: the air temperature where the player is, from Frostfall, for everyone in the scene #}
{# Follows 0200 (scene context, which carries the weather). Always present while Frostfall runs: a short line
   NPCs can make small talk about, and the air reference for NPCs whose own cold another mod (SeverActions'
   survival) describes. Frostfall's Weathersense tiers, worded without the sun (it can be hot under cloud):
   >= 18 hot, 15-17 warm, 11-14 pleasant, 10 temperate, 6-9 cool, 1-5 chilly, -4..0 cold, -9..-5 biting cold,
   -14..-10 bone-chilling, < -14 frigid and deadly. FrostfallCurrentTemperatureReadOnly is the Update.esm mirror,
   the same in both Frostfall builds; FrostfallRunning 2 = running. Frostfall gives interiors their own air
   (temperate in a heated building), so the line always describes where the player is, indoors or out.
#}
{% if is_plugin_loaded("Frostfall.esp") and get_global_value("FrostfallRunning") == 2 %}
{% set fa_temp = get_global_value("FrostfallCurrentTemperatureReadOnly") %}
{% if fa_temp >= 18 %}{% set fa_air = "hot" %}
{% else if fa_temp >= 15 %}{% set fa_air = "warm" %}
{% else if fa_temp >= 11 %}{% set fa_air = "pleasant" %}
{% else if fa_temp >= 10 %}{% set fa_air = "temperate" %}
{% else if fa_temp >= 6 %}{% set fa_air = "cool" %}
{% else if fa_temp >= 1 %}{% set fa_air = "chilly" %}
{% else if fa_temp >= -4 %}{% set fa_air = "cold" %}
{% else if fa_temp >= -9 %}{% set fa_air = "biting cold" %}
{% else if fa_temp >= -14 %}{% set fa_air = "bone-chilling" %}
{% else %}{% set fa_air = "frigid and deadly" %}
{% endif %}
{# Its own heading: 0200 ends with Recent Events, and an unheaded line would read as one of them. #}
## Air Temperature
The air is {{ fa_air }}.
{% endif %}
